rong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1326\">🛒 Affordable Prices, Exceptional Value</strong><br data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">We believe great lighting shouldn’t break the bank. OKELI offers direct-to-consumer pricing, ensuring you get designer looks without the designer markup.</p><p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1552\">Light up your home the OKELI way — with style, efficiency, and care.</p></div>",
